{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgmz8DSwzch1BWx4CyZ7J","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'll ask you, or go to the bank, before I move anything. I'm not sure at all. If I had to point at something today, it would be a \"גמל אג\"ח ממשלות\" track, because I know government bonds are safe. At מיטב it shows \"0.52%\" from savings and \"4.9%\" for 3 years, and \"מניות 0%\". But I couldn't tell what most of the page meant.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **Top of the page.** \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". I pressed nothing; the button \"תגמולים ואישית לפיצויים 182\" was already lit. 182 tracks from 15 companies is too many for me.\n- **The orange box.** \"נתוני הרשות לא עודכנו מאז ספטמבר 2026\" worried me. Can I trust the numbers?\n- **The list of companies.** I went through מיטב, מור, הפניקס, אלטשולר שחם, כלל and הראל, and stopped at the start of אנליסט. These names I know. I looked for words I know: \"אג\"ח ממשלות\", \"כספי (שקלי)\", \"אשראי ואג\"ח\".\n  - In the safe-sounding tracks the share number was \"0%\" and the yearly figures were small, about 4% to 5%.\n  - The \"מניות\" and \"S&P500\" tracks show big numbers like \"22.07%\" and \"28.61%\". Things that rise that much can fall that much, so I won't go near them.\n  - The fees go from \"0.15%\" (הפניקס, \"גמל בניהול אישי\") to \"2%\".\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The row of filter buttons under \"במה הכסף מושקע\".\n- The search box.\n- The little round charts. I don't know what they show.\n- Everything after screen five.\n\n**Words and signs I didn't understand**\n- \"s&p 500\", S&P500: just English letters to me.\n- \"עוקב מדדים\", \"עוקב מדדי מניות\", \"גמיש\".\n- \"מט\"ח\" with a percentage next to it, and \"101%\" or \"103%\". How can it be more than 100?\n- \"ההפקדה\" next to \"ההיסכון\". Is that a second fee?\n- \"עוד לא דווח\" with a little orange \"!\", and \"לא דווח\". It looked like a warning.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\".\n- \"אין\" in the place of a fee.\n- The numbers with arrows next to the names, like \"1486\" and \"13246\".\n- \"123 ממקור\", \"123 מחושב\", \"123 הזנה\".\n- \"תשואה שנתית ממוצעת לפני דמי ניהול\": is \"4.9%\" for 3 years per year or for all three years? I'm not sure.\n\n**What tired me or bothered me**\n- The whole page is black with thin grey writing, and the first lines in each row are faint.\n- Every row repeats the same words: \"ההיסכון\", \"ההפקדה\", \"מניות\", \"מט\"ח\", \"3 שנים\", \"5 שנים\". I kept reading them again in every row just to find the number that's different.\n- The colour dots next to \"מניות\" and \"מט\"ח\" belong to the round chart. Their colours are close and I couldn't match them.\n- By the fourth screen my eyes hurt. By the fifth I stopped.\n- Nowhere does it say in one simple sentence which track is safe like a deposit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3532,"cache_read_input_tokens":18410,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3532},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5710160b-3aee-4284-beb2-ec053d29e223","uuid":"8ce8bd65-f06e-4d8a-a2a5-2125534eec46","timestamp":"2026-11-06T16:25:23.325Z","request_id":"req_011Cgmz8D9LeXasyEP5JLXHT"}
